/33246","statements":[{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BEYOND RAW(R) RE-FEED - maximize recovery for limitless, unbounded lean muscle potential with this new, more powerful, more concentrated formula."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The 25g immediate and sustained-release protein complex is loaded to the max with our most extreme anabolic muscle-mind-body primers to provide you with amazing-tasting, maltodextrin-free recovery power all while you sleep, plus there's more."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"This powerful muscle fuel has reduced carbs and fewer calories than ever before plus features the hottest new supplementation methodology in sports nutrition, the Physiobolic Edge. This new system is based off the latest research that targets the following 9 Primal Physiogenic Factors all working to provide you with the ultimate, overnight recovery coverage.*\n- Anabolic Hormones\n- Anabolic Primers\n- N.O. Pumps\n- Carbohydrate Metabolism\n- Fat Metabolism\n- Muscle Cell Energy\n- Muscle Cell Protection & Recovery*\n- Water Regulation\n- Mental Intensity & Neuro Priming"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The harder you train, the more your muscles need to recuperate, so kick back and unwind while the powerful ANABOLIC MAXIMIZER works both instantly and continuously to provide you with potent recovery support important for the growth and repair of muscles."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"This includes new and improved sources of the ultimate Anabolic Primers: leucine from both a novel potato protein and slow-digesting casein for a sustained supply of amino acids that support powerful anti-catabolic signals to protect muscles from breaking down, plus 600mg Testofen(R) to trigger the most powerful Anabolic Hormone in the body required for growth and peak performance with the added benefit of sexual health.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Every serious warrior knows you need high-quality rest because intense exercise may contribute the depletion of critical amino acids and key nutrients."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Now you can rest assured knowing that HARDCORE MUSCLE SUPPORT SYSTEM includes a 10g glutamine complex with OT2(TM) technology-enhanced glutamine designed to release slowly over a 6-hour period while providing ongoing amino acid fuel for muscle protein synthesis, immune and digestion support. To further provide you with superior Muscle Cell Protection & Recovery, 5mg Lutemax 2020(TM) Lutein and 100mg of turmeric are two of the many powerful antioxidants included in this potent formula to combat molecular damage that inherently occurs from intense training. Resveratrol is also included to further aid in the delivery of muscle fuel while priming the blood vessels for N.O. Pumps.*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"After you torture your muscles with extreme training, you need to rest and recover. The RECOVERY POTENTIATOR COMPOUND works to aid in restful sleep and further supports nighttime recovery with GABA to target Neuro Priming. While the PM METABOLIC OPTIMIZER fuels lean muscle and enhances Fat Metabolism with L-carnitine, powerful minerals work to support Muscle Cell Energy, Carbohydrate Metabolism and Water Regulation for maximum recovery power.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BEYOND RAW(R) RE-FEED supplies the ammunition that every hardcore warrior needs to master extreme training goals and exactly when you need it most - a constant flow of high-quality anabolic, muscle-fueling nutrients. Prepare yourself. Experience the difference. Go beyond basic muscle recovery - get BEYOND RAW(R)!"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PHYSIOBOLIC EDGE"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The Physiobolic Edge is the advanced, performance-based technology powering the sciences behind GNC BEYOND RAW(R) with more than best-in-class, cutting-edge ingredients."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"This new, research-based system advances molecular functions not yet targeted by other products by synchronizing with vital phsiological mechanisms and genetic pathways before, during and after extreme workouts that unleash your maximum muscle-mind-body potential. This powerful addition gives hardcore sports nutrition a new meaning: physiogenic performance fuel as you push for a physique like never before, muscle-maximizing size, explosive strength and power.* This Physiobolic Edge targets the exact 10 factors that open the door to extreme results."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Defined by our expert scientists as the \"genesis of the Physiobolic Edge,\" the following 10 Primal Physiogenic Factors are what you need to support extreme training results.\n- Anabolic Hormones\n- Muscle Cell Energy\n- N.O. Pmps\n- Muscle Cell Protection & Recovery\n- Fat Metabolism\n- Carbohydrate Metabolism\n- Increased Calorie Burning\n- Water Regulation\n- Mental Intensity & Neuro Priming\n- Anabolic Primers"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW AND IMPROVED!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"SUPER ANABOLIC LEAN MUSCLE & NIGHTTIME RECOVERY PROTEIN"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"+ ULTIMATE HARDCORE, 25G IMMEDIATE & SUSTAINED-RELEASE PROTEIN COMPLEX FOR MUSCLE GROWTH & REPAIR*\n+ 10G GLUTAMINE COMPLEX PLUS POTENT ANABOLIC MAXIMIZER WITH 5G LEUCINE TO PROTECT DENSE MUSCLE & 600MG TESTOFEN(R) TO SUPPORT HEALTHY TESTOSTERONE LEVELS*\n+ PM METABOLIC OPTIMIZER REGULATES METABOLISM WITH 250MG L-CARNITINE, GREEN TEA & 200MG GREEN COFFEE AS YOU BATTLE FOR EXTREME MUSCULARITY*\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"+ NOW MORE CONCENTRATED TARGETING 9 PRIMAL PHYSIOGENIC FACTORS FOR BEYOND HARDCORE RESULTS*"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"PHYSIOBOLIC EDGE"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"NITRO-FACTOR 29G(TM)"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"BANNED SUBSTANCE FREE"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"OT2\nOPTIMAL TIMING TECHNOLOGY(TM)"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"NATURAL & ARTIFICIAL FLAVOR"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 826345 JOG"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, mix one serving (41.76 g) with 10 fl. oz. of water 30-60 minutes prior to bedtime or between meals. For extreme results, take twice daily."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical Amino Acid Profile Per Serving\nAlanine 732 mg\nArginine 915 mg\nAspartate 1843 mg\nCystine 138 mg\nGlutamine & Glutamic Acid* 10152 mg\nGlycine 481 mg\nHistidine 632 mg\nIsoleucine * 1178 mg\nLeucine* 5000 mg\nLysine 1951 mg\nMethionine 628 mg\nPhenylalanine 1242 mg\nProline 2413 mg\nSerine 1372 mg \nThreonin 1056 mg\nTryptophan 2312 mg\nTyrosine 1204 mg\nValine* 1548mg\nTotal 34794mg\nIndicates Branched Chain Amino Acids (BCAA)\n*Denotes naturally occurring and added free from amino acids."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Lutemax 2020(TM) is a trademark of OmniActive Health Technologies.\nresVida(R) is a trademark of DSM.\nTestofen(R) is a registered trademark of Gencor."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"*Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2014 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via HFL skip lost testing protocaol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"^When used in conjunction with regular resistance training."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Consult with your physician prior to use if you are pregnant or nursing, taking medication, or have a medical condition."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: Use as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{QRC} SCAN & LEARN MORE or visit www.gnc.com/beyondraw"}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 13746 5","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}